flowchart TD
    Q[User Query]
    S{Retrieval Model}
    T[TF-IDF Vectorizer]
    TV[Stored TF-IDF Document Vectors]
    ST[Sentence Transformer Model]
    TE[Stored Content Embeddings]
    TI[Generate Document Title Embeddings]
    CS[Content Similarity]
    TS[Title Similarity]
    COMB[Combined Score: 0.5 Title + 0.5 Content]
    R[Rank Documents]
    O[Top-k Retrieved Documents]

    Q --> S
    S -->|TF-IDF| T
    T --> TV
    TV --> R
    S -->|Semantic| ST
    ST --> TE
    ST --> TI
    Q --> ST
    ST --> CS
    TE --> CS
    TI --> TS
    CS --> COMB
    TS --> COMB
    COMB --> R
    R --> O
